export anchor FilmNoirStyle:
    number: 275
    screen: CloudFiles
    name: Film noir
    idea: A black and white case file lit through venetian blinds, typewriter captions on every fact, the selected file printed in reverse like a lone lit window.
    base: dark
    palette:
        black: #0b0b0b, the page, the style sheet and text on white
        wall: #141414, the header wall under the blinds
        paper: #1c1c1c, the desk behind the file table
        dossier: #181818, the details column
        print: #2b2b2b, the photo print frame
        ink: #ececec, body text
        grey: #a8a8a8, captions, column heads, meta and placeholders
        rule: #4a4a4a, dotted and double rules
        white: #f4f4f4, the primary button, the selected row, the pressed switch and the focus outline
    type:
        Titles in a high contrast serif, Bodoni 72, Didot, Big Caslon, Times
        New Roman, bold capitals, 46px for the folder title and 24px for
        Details. Everything else in Courier New typewriter at 15px with 1.5
        line height. Buttons 13px bold caps tracked 0.1em, captions and
        column heads 12px caps tracked 0.2em in grey.
    layout:
        A header wall with a soft light pool top right and diagonal blind
        shadows, made of skewed translucent stripes, clipped by the header.
        On it sit a small typed line Brightwork Drive case file, the title
        Website redesign, a boxed typed breadcrumb with slashes, and a row
        of trapezoid folder tabs for My files, Shared with me, Recent,
        Starred and Trash, the current tab lighter with a white top line.
        Below is a desk in two columns. The main column has an underlined
        Search files field, Upload, New folder and a List or Grid switch
        with List in white. Then a real table captioned Contents of Website
        redesign with 8 entries, columns No., Name, Size, Modified and
        Notes, numbered 01 to 08, rows split by dotted rules. The selected
        row is printed in reverse, white with black text. Statuses are
        bracketed typed words. Uploading has ten small boxes with six
        filled. A storage ledger under the table shows a dashed bar and
        64.2 GB of 100 GB used. A 320px details column holds a slightly
        tilted grey photo print of the preview with a typed caption,
        Starred, owner, size, version and shared with as typed rows, and
        full width Share, Download and Get link. Below 960px the details
        drop under the desk. Below 700px table rows become stacked blocks.
    spacing: An 8px unit. 40px gutters, 12px cell padding, 24px between blocks.
    density: Medium. A numbered ledger with dotted rules.
    corners: Square. Folder tabs are trapezoids.
    borders: Double rules above table heads and between sections, dotted rules between rows, 1px grey outlines on secondary controls.
    shadows: Only a hard black offset under the tilted print.
    icons:
        Thin 1.4px line icons in grey and white. Status is a bracketed
        typed word with a filled star for Starred, two heads for Shared, an
        up arrow for Uploading and a checked box for Selected.
    focus: A 2px white outline offset 3px.
    tone: Typed and terse, such as case file, Contents and Notes.
